    {
      "id": "claim_b370ead4134d44cbad1b438754d8a08b",
      "statement": "Citation.components always exposes num_evidence_spans (the count of spans after merging and after any fallback collapse) and evidence_chars_total (the sum of span.char_end - span.char_start across evidence_spans), so callers can detect multi-span behavior without iterating spans.",
