    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dabfcfb645df4c4c832e3f889f8aeb67",
      "statement": "SpanCitations status (\"supported\", \"partial\", \"unsupported\") is determined by the best exact citation's answer_coverage and contradiction check, not by the number of evidence spans; multi-span does not change status and does not promote a passage that failed to localize into a Citation.",
